2) after extracting  get 3 jar files ,1 dtd file and log4jconfig.xmlfile

3) that 3 jar files we need to put in following path (C:\ProgramData\IBM\MQSI\shared-classes)

4) then we need to do some changes in log4jconfiguration.xml file those are like:

*here you need to give dtd path
* then we need to give log file path in appenders like 
